repository-code: "https://github.com/JasonOA888/china-treatment-price-index"
abstract: >-
  Open dataset of published prices for 41 medical procedures in China that
  foreign patients commonly seek, across public, public international/VIP and
  private hospital tiers, with source URL, source type, publication date,
  check date and confidence for every record, plus citable US
  reference prices. Primary currency CNY; USD approximations at 1 USD = 6.6681
  CNY (2026-10-26).
keywords:
  - China
  - healthcare prices
  - medical tourism
  - price transparency
  - NHSA
  - open data
